com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119033","id":4334624172,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAl0drA","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-28T11:02:53Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T11:35:22Z","body":"Related:\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118109\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118147\n\nHello! May I ask if the issue is reproducible in Steam? Does Steam recognize the adapter and it works fine?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4334624172/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4334904898","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119033#issuecomment-4334904898","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119033","id":4334904898,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAmFmQg","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-28T11:44:59Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T11:46:44Z","body":"It seems that the adapter shouldn't be recognized by Steam either, and SDL requires libusb on Windows as well, which also means the OS driver for the device will have to be detached with Zadig to get working.\nThat doesn't sound like a good default behavior, so I suppose we will have to disable the GameCube HIDAPI driver on Windows by default to avoid the engine getting frozen.\nIf we do want to support GameCube controllers on Windows we will have to ship libusb with Godot binaries, which most likely means we will have to compile libusb inside of Godot's build system, I'm not currently sure if that's worth it.\n\nSee also:\n- https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/issues/4199\n- https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/issues/14682\n- https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/issues/7481","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4334904898/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4336285567","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119033#issuecomment-4336285567","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119033","id":4336285567,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAnZ3fw","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-28T14:37:20Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T14:37:20Z","body":"Bundling libusb is a non-starter. It uses the [LGPL-2.1 license](https://github.com/libusb/libusb#LGPL-2.1-1-ov-file), which is fundamentally incompatible with our MIT license. Relevant except from our contributor docs[^1]:\n\n> Most other licenses are not compatible with Godot's license. This includes \"copy-left\" licenses like GPL or LGPL, since these licenses effectively disallow static linking in proprietary software (which Godot is distributed as in most exported projects). This also applies for libraries that are only linked in the editor.\n\nThat having been said, there might be an avenue for simply *supporting* libusb, as LGPL permits dynamic-linkage. I haven't messed with libusb in years, so I can't say for sure how easily that could be setup, but there's *some* potential there at least\n\n[^1]: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#respect-copyright","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4336285567/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4336686441","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119033#issuecomment-4336686441","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119033","id":4336686441,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAnyVaQ","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-28T15:23:36Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T15:23:36Z","body":"Cannot replicate this issue locally. Tested with a MayFlash adapter (both modes) and the Input Integrity Lossless Adapter; Godot launched without issue every time\n\nNotably: SDL only reported noticing the GameCube adapter in MayFlash PC mode. The Nintendo-native equivalents aren't recognized whatsoever, so I'm unsure how you're even being detected in the first place","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4336686441/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4337992918","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119033#issuecomment-4337992918","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119033","id":4337992918,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABApCE1g","user":{"login":"agoy184","id":73681996,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjgxOTk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73681996?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoy184","html_url":"https://github.com/agoy184","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoy184/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoy184/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoy184/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoy184/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoy184/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoy184/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoy184/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoy184/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoy184/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-28T18:19:13Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T18:19:13Z","body":"> Please paste the error message as text as well, and please put the different parts of the report in the correct parts\nThis is the full extent of what appears in the term