ps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118147)\n> \n> Hello! May I ask if the issue is reproducible in Steam? Does Steam recognize the adapter and it works fine?\n\nI tested it with steam and it refuses to open there as well.  I've attached 3 videos below displaying the issue\n\nOpening godot 4.6.2 exe without the adapter vs opening it after p/lugging in the adapter(IMG3152)\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1_8ss0Ib_X8H75Chq9KNDlYlwZ4S0C9NZ/view?usp=sharing\n\nRunning Godot verbosely in terminal powershell to assesss the problem, final msg that pops up is about mayflash (IMG3155)\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1mnUkPQWLvJNOd7fNzFtXD0wNRYjLnMW0/view?usp=sharing\n\nRunning on steam with the controller adapter unplugged vs plugged in (IMG3156)\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1ZsKr8apcvFjW97-mgQvvVUyo54r_czpp/view?usp=sharing","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4338054902/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4338074789","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119033#issuecomment-4338074789","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119033","id":4338074789,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABApHEpQ","user":{"login":"agoy184","id":73681996,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjgxOTk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73681996?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoy184","html_url":"https://github.com/agoy184","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoy184/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoy184/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoy184/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoy184/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoy184/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoy184/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoy184/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoy184/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoy184/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-28T18:33:08Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T18:33:08Z","body":"I'm realizing now that it may have to do with the xbox controller emulator, i recently used that to play a game and it affected another engine that I had been working with (Defold) and created a similar issue \nhttps://www.x360ce.com/","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4338074789/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4338079930","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119033#issuecomment-4338079930","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119033","id":4338079930,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABApHYug","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"